1
00:00:00,563 --> 00:00:04,233
(Amy:)Sheldon, you being here might
not be making things better.

2
00:00:04,298 --> 00:00:06,198
(Sheldon:)I see.

3
00:00:06,267 --> 00:00:08,807
(Sheldon:)And is that why
everybody was invited but me?

4
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:10,800
(Amy:)They didn't invite
everybody but you.

5
00:00:10,872 --> 00:00:12,372
(Amy:)Bernadette invited me,

6
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,670
(Amy:)and Stuart lives here.

7
00:00:13,742 --> 00:00:16,442
(singsongy):
Who wants hot cinnamon rolls?

8
00:00:19,347 --> 00:00:22,247
(Official:)So, when you hear the music,
that's your cue.

9
00:00:22,316 --> 00:00:23,556
(Official:)Any questions?

10
00:00:23,618 --> 00:00:25,518
(Leonard:)Oh, the package
that we paid for

11
00:00:25,586 --> 00:00:28,116
(Leonard:)said the aisle was supposed
to be strewn with rose petals.

12
00:00:28,188 --> 00:00:29,488
(Official:)Where are the rose petals?!

13
00:00:29,557 --> 00:00:31,587
WOMAN: We're out!
You know what?

14
00:00:31,659 --> 00:00:32,859
(Leonard:)It's fine.

15
00:00:32,927 --> 00:00:35,327
WOMAN: We can use the
potpourri from the bathroom!

16
00:00:35,395 --> 00:00:37,035
(Penny:)Really, we're good.
(chuckles)

17
00:00:37,097 --> 00:00:38,667
(Leonard:)Yup, just want
to get married.

18
00:00:38,732 --> 00:00:39,862
(Sheldon:)Yeah.
Great.

19
00:00:39,934 --> 00:00:41,904
(Official:)I'll see you two
up there.

20
00:00:44,404 --> 00:00:46,904
(Leonard:)This is it.
I know.

21
00:00:46,974 --> 00:00:49,704
(Leonard:)I love you.

22
00:00:49,776 --> 00:00:51,676
(Penny:)I love you, too.

23
00:00:51,744 --> 00:00:54,184
WOMAN: Was that a yes
or no on the potpourri?!

